{
  "slug": "rkstack",
  "name": "Rkstack",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Complete AI development workflow — 22 skills that guide the full cycle from idea to shipped code. Brainstorm a design, write an implementation plan, execute with TDD, debug systematically, get a two-pass code review, and ship with confidence. Includes a humanizer for natural prose, a security auditor (OWASP + STRIDE), and safety hooks that block destructive commands. Detects your project stack automatically and adapts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **40 skills**, **2 agents** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (40): `benchmark` (Performance regression detection using the browse daemon), `brainstorming` (Explore ideas before implementation), `browse` (Headless browser for web QA, screenshots, and interaction), `canary` (Post-deploy canary monitoring), `careful` (Safety guardrails for destructive commands), `codex-cli-runtime` (Internal helper contract for calling the codex-companion runtime from the codex-rescue subagent), `codex-help` (User-invocable skill for when Claude is stuck mid-task), `codex-result-handling` (Internal contract for presenting Codex output back to the user), and 32 more\n- **Agents** (2): `code-reviewer` (Use this agent when a major project step has been completed and needs to be reviewed against the…), `codex-rescue` (Proactively use when Claude Code is stuck, wants a second implementation or diagnosis pass, needs a deeper root-cause…)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rkstack@claude-community` from `mrkhachaturov/rkstack`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 40,
    "agent": 2,
    "hook": 2
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
